    "type": "html",
    "html": "<article><h1>Catalyzing scientific impact through global partnerships and open resources</h1><p>Published: <time datetime=\"2026-05-01T00:00:00+00:00\">2026-05-01</time></p><p>Canonical link: <a href=\"https://research.google/blog/catalyzing-scientific-impact-through-global-partnerships-and-open-resources\">https://research.google/blog/catalyzing-scientific-impact-through-global-partnerships-and-open-resources</a></p><p>Author: The Google Research Science team</p><div class=\"blog-summary__summary\">\n          <p>\n            Our approach to open science is built on responsible, inclusive, and rigorous research\n            so more teams can build on high-impact discoveries.\n          </p>\n        </div><div class=\"rich-text --theme-light --mode-standalone\" data-gt-id=\"rich_text\">\n          <p>\n            A scientific breakthrough reaches its full potential when other researchers can\n            replicate and extend the work.\n          </p>\n        </div><div class=\"rich-text --theme-light --mode-standalone\" data-gt-id=\"rich_text\">\n          <div class=\"component-intro\"><h2>Partnerships and ecosystem collaboration</h2></div>\n          <p>\n            Google Research works with specialized institutions to expand access to tools,\n            datasets, and reproducible methods.\n          </p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Shared benchmarks and open datasets.</li>\n            <li>Cross-disciplinary collaboration with research partners.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div></article>",
